# Response headers for the deployed site. Cloudflare reads this file out of the
# deploy bundle; it is never served to a browser.
#
# Note what is NOT here: an `immutable` cache on /assets/*. The media filenames
# carry no content hash (agent-session.mp4 keeps its name across re-records), so
# a year-long cache would strand visitors on a stale capture. An hour, with a
# week of stale-while-revalidate, keeps the edge doing the work without that.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, stale-while-revalidate=604800
